' Jacaloria — arquitetura em 4 camadas
' Preview: https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml
@startuml Jacaloria - Arquitetura
title Jacaloria — Arquitetura
caption Mesma origem HTTPS: jacaloria.online
footer Deploy: GitHub Actions (OIDC) publica a API (Docker, ECR, Elastic Beanstalk) e o Flutter Web (S3 + invalidação CloudFront)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 18
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #0F172A
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam linetype ortho

skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #0F172A
  FontColor #0F172A
  FontSize 15
}

top to bottom direction

rectangle "**1. Clientes**\n\nFlutter Web (PWA)        ·        Flutter Android / iOS\ncâmera · Google Sign-In · notificações · widget" as clientes #BBF7D0

rectangle "**2. CloudFront + ACM**\nhttps://jacaloria.online\n\nsite (SPA)          =>  S3\nAPI e dashboard     =>  NestJS" as edge #FDBA74

rectangle "**3. Origens AWS**\n\n**S3** — Flutter Web estático (privado)\n**Elastic Beanstalk** — API NestJS (Docker :3000)\nAuth, Meals, AI, Social, Missions, Performance, Notifications" as aws #FDE68A

rectangle "**4. Dados e serviços**\n\n**Postgres** (Supabase + TACO)     **Storage** (fotos)     **Gemini** (visão)\n**Google Identity** (Sign-In)     **SMTP** (e-mail)" as deps #EDE9FE

clientes -down-> edge : HTTPS
edge -down-> aws
aws -down-> deps

@enduml
